  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f201ca7f57d3ab332a39d6e7e4133ac6, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 
  lines:
  - Oh, Hello there. Are you trying to reach the castle?
  - As you know, this land doesn't have a King anymore, the throne is vacant.
  - The High guard of the realm can't decide a heir, and the world is slowly collapsing
    on itself
  - Please, if you are willing to conquer the throne, be aware of the challenges
    the High Guard has placed all around this path.
  - Every corner you cross, can hide a real threat. I've left a bow for the wanderers
    like you that are trying reach the castle. Feel free to take it!
  - 'OH... One last thing: Have you noticed those strange coins in the area? I heard
    voices that speak about an altar in the castle.'
  - Apparently, if you have a rich offer to leave, the Gods will strengthen your
    body... I don't know if I believe in this things, but I also saw magicians around
    here... Who knows!
  summaryLine: Have you taken some coins with you? And don't forget to take my bow...
    Please do your best to save this realm.
